- Formal review subagents could not launch because the agent thread limit was
  reached. The main-thread Standards/Spec review found and fixed a half-open
  probe race, JWKS stale-window overrun, and fail-open ban-check fallback.

External boundary: no production dependency fault injection, traffic,
threshold tuning, remote deployment or production configuration mutation was
executed.
